        ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n$$\n8\\,\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{10}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{10}\\right)\\csc\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right).\n$$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the given expression. Use $\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin(2x)$ at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{10}$, then $\\csc x=1/\\sin x$. The nonzero sine cancels.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=4\\,\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)\\csc\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)\\\\&=4\\,\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)}{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)}\\\\&=4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
